	(text "BenchPod v4 pogo fixture. Passive: the controller (a BenchPod) drives J1.\nJ2: 8 P75 probes in R75 receptacles (1.7 mm plated holes), under the pod's J10 pads.\nThe pod sits on M2.5 standoffs in H1/H2 (its holes H11/H14). H3/H4 are feet.\nJ1 to the controller: target power (5V) on POD_5V, SWD, NRST and the pod console\n(POD_TX = pod USART2 TX, read it on a controller UART RX)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 91.44 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
